              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at’ Imibavu mwoshereje mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu nzira z’i Yerusalemu, mwe na ba sogokuruza n’abami banyu n’abaganwa banyu n’abantu bo mu gihugu, mbeg’ Uhoraho ntiyayibutse, ntivyinjiye mu mutima wiwe? ",
